            "Here\u2019s a clean, heartfelt post you can use:\n\n---\n\nI still remember Donivan standing up in kindergarten, giving his little speeches in his classical education\u2026 practicing his words, learning confidence, finding his voice.\n\nAnd now here we are.\n\nWatching him stand on stage again, delivering his oral defense as a senior\u2026 his last big moment as a high school student.\n\nIt\u2019s hard to even put into words what that feels like as a parent.\n\nTo see my baby boy grow up into someone so capable, so composed, so incredible\u2026 it fills my heart with so much pride and happiness.\n\nDonivan, we are so proud of you. Every step, every stage, every moment has led to this\u2026 and you\u2019ve handled it all with strength and grace.\n\nWe can\u2019t wait to see what this next chapter holds for you. \ud83e\udd0d"
