ht\u201d senior energy\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfaf If You Want It To Feel MORE PROUD than SAD\nGo with:\n- **My Wish**\n- **Unwritten**\n- **Count on Me**\n\n### \ud83d\ude2d If You Want It To Hit Emotionally\nGo with:\n- **Never Grow Up**\n- **7 Years**\n- **You\u2019re Gonna Miss This**\n\n---\n\n### \u26a1 Quick CapCut Tip\nSearch the song \u2192 **use the chorus or emotional build (not the intro)**  \nThat\u2019s what makes it feel powerful in short clips.\n\n---\n\nIf you tell me:\n- boy or girl vibe  \n- more happy vs emotional  \n- sports? graduation? childhood clips?\n\nI\u2019ll pick the **exact 10-second timestamp** of the song so you don\u2019t have to guess."
