          "parts": [
            "Here are some **CapCut soundbite / audio ideas** that hit that *proud mom + senior year + emotional growth* vibe without feeling cheesy. I\u2019ll give you exact phrases + what to search so you can find them fast \ud83d\udc47\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf93 Emotional / Proud Parent Vibe\nSearch in CapCut:\n- **\u201cTime flies\u201d**\n- **\u201cThey grow up so fast\u201d**\n- **\u201cProud moment\u201d**\n- **\u201cI\u2019m so proud of you\u201d**\n\nSoundbite-style lines you can overlay:\n- \u201cHow did we get here so fast?\u201d\n- \u201cI blinked\u2026 and now he\u2019s grown.\u201d\n- \u201cThis is what proud feels like.\u201d\n- \u201cAll those little moments led to this.\u201d\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcac Voiceover Style (More Personal / Luxora-level storytelling)\nIf you record your own voice (highly recommend, performs better):\n\n- \u201cI don\u2019t know where the time went\u2026 but I\u2019m so proud of the man you\u2019ve become.\u201d\n- \u201cFrom little boy to senior\u2026 and somehow my heart just keeps growing with you.\u201d\n- \u201cThis season\u2026 I\u2019m just really proud.\u201d\n- \u201cWatching you become who you are has been my greatest gift.\u201d\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfb6 Background Audio That Works Really Well\nSearch in CapCut or TikTok sounds:\n\n- **\u201cSlipping Through My Fingers\u201d \u2013 ABBA** (super emotional, trending for kids growing up)\n- **\u201cNever Grow Up\u201d \u2013 Taylor Swift** (classic mom content)\n- **\u201cMy Wish\u201d \u2013 Rascal Flatts**\n- **\u201cYou\u2019re Gonna Miss This\u201d \u2013 Trace Adkins**\n- **Instrumental piano / soft cinematic** (search: *\u201cemotional piano\u201d, \u201cmemory music\u201d*)\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd25 If You Want It To Hit HARD (Short Hook Line)\nUse one of these as the opening text/audio:\n\n- \u201cThis one hurts\u2026 in the best way.\u201d\n- \u201cNo one prepares you for this part.\u201d\n- \u201cI prayed for this version of you.\u201d\n- \u201cSenior year\u2026 and I\u2019m not okay about it.\u201d\n- \u201cSo proud. So emotional. All at once.\u201d\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udde0 Pro Tip (this is what makes it go viral)\nLayer it like this:\n1. **Hook text (first 1\u20132 sec)**\n2. Soft emotional music\n3. Clips of him growing up \u2192 now\n4. End with: *\u201cSo proud of you, always.\u201d*\n\n---\n\nIf you want, I can **write the exact CapCut script with timing + text overlays + clip order** so you can literally drop it in and post."
